 runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"3e013b1470c7e04ff1a1aa806502a4f7","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"b4f0245d88a78e19974ffa7d21e7b53a","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"e775d22ab4272025c839ad5f21978e3e","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"cc6a77376bbc38f339b45bbe0792c1c8","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"ed460648e29a5f33eb1f55d0f2e04c54","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"7824101f768d99f520a04f31d039d2d6","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"6c252d5b6d83c5256c9104fdef26f238","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"80affd9dc7df269b44f8abb71883f15f","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"42c8051a03369cc1d3d01823503df6d7","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[True]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1794999786349,"stop":1794999786452,"duration":103,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":"as